      "name": "Fresh rose petals",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together the muscovado sugar, almond flour, and cocoa powder.",
    "Add the coconut oil, eggs, vanilla extract, and salt to the bowl and mix until well combined.",
    "Stir in the dark chocolate chips, pistachios, and honey.",
    "Pour the mixture into a greased 9x9-inch baking dish and smooth the top.",
    "Bake for 35 minutes, or until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.",
    "Remove the dish from the oven and sprinkle with fresh rose petals.",
    "Let the bake cool completely before serving.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with additional rose petals if desired."
  ],
